{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Good Day Fishing is a gamified focus tool where you catch fish while completing real-life tasks. Reel in and record new species, decorate your favorite cozy fishing spot, and customize your soundscape to create a custom vibe to help you relax and boost concentration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE UNIQUE FISHING LOCATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/timerv2.gif?t=1752788350\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new bait and tackle, catch unique fish at your favorite fishing spot, and keep track of your best catches! All while staying on top of your real-world tasks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RELAXING ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tailor your in-game ambiance to your taste with dozens of cozy visual/audio effect combinations including cozy activities, weather, and even the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/Ambiance.gif?t=1752788350\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMPROVE FOCUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Good Day Fishing is designed to help you have better days:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Pomodoro, meditation, and sleep fishing timers to facilitate your day-to-day accomplishments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track your todo list</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize  effects and animations to promote a state of flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress idly and interactively </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/taskswide-133.jpg?t=1752788350\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADORABLE CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your appearance and decorate your fishing camp\u00a0with your hard earned fish coins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FROG?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a frog. Batteries not included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/Frog.png?t=1752788350\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649860?t=1752788350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/938fabd92e893a629528846cfb539f13d94d32f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752788350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/e38af47878591d472fa6ea8593a8e4b39c29118d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752788350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/e38af47878591d472fa6ea8593a8e4b39c29118d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752788350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Good Day Fishing is a gamified focus tool where you catch fish while completing real-life tasks. Reel in and record new species, decorate your favorite cozy fishing spot, and customize your soundscape to create a custom vibe to help you relax and boost concentration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE UNIQUE FISHING LOCATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/timerv2.gif?t=1752788350\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new bait and tackle, catch unique fish at your favorite fishing spot, and keep track of your best catches! All while staying on top of your real-world tasks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">